# Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key. `.env` is gitignored — it stays
# only on your machine and is never committed or sent anywhere.
#
# Get a key: Google Cloud Console → enable "Places API (New)" → Credentials →
# create an API key. Restrict it to the Places API. A free monthly credit covers
# light use. Without a key, the app falls back to the curated venue list.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
